    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick 1 **ASPECT WARRIORS** or **AVATAR OF KHAINE** unit of yours that at least 1 of those attacks targets.\n\nYou may remove 1 of its Aspect Shrine tokens. Then, for the rest of the phase, whenever 1 of its models is **destroyed** before it has fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 if you removed a token. On a 4+:\n\n1. Leave the model in play.\n2. It can fight once the attacking unit has made all its attacks.\n3. Then remove it.",
